  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/taint1/). VERDICT: CURRENT. 2026-11-01 review on dev 100b6fbb6e: CFG+def/use probe still gives python 'o.attr = 1' def=[o] use=[] and go 'cmd.Stdin, cmd.Stdout = os.Stdin, x' def=[cmd,cmd] use=[os,x]; the earlier def of o/cmd is killed. verify-claims on the Request/req.timeout/urlopen shape: ddg_mixed escaped with the field store, ddg reached without it. NOT-CHECKED part probed: msg = secret; msg.tag = 1; sock.sendall(msg) escapes (refuted 0, removed 0). Premise unchanged. MECHANISM: field/attribute store recorded as a strong def of the base variable with no use (no weak update). SHARES MECHANISM WITH: WI-ruhuv,INV-dukam,WI-buzup."  # e7f1
